usage: cami [-h]
            {task,memory,watch,find,setup-typescript,check-inputs,run,demo,score,compare,prepare-scenario,prepare-pilot,pilot-run,pilot-report,pilot-environments,annotate-export,freeze,annotate-import,analyze}
            ...

positional arguments:
  {task,memory,watch,find,setup-typescript,check-inputs,run,demo,score,compare,prepare-scenario,prepare-pilot,pilot-run,pilot-report,pilot-environments,annotate-export,freeze,annotate-import,analyze}
    task                run OpenCode with automatic input and usage capture
    memory              persistent structural facts and manual notes
    watch               refresh product memory as the worktree changes
    find                find Python, JS, and TS definitions in worktree or Git
                        snapshots
    setup-typescript    install the pinned trusted compiler in your user cache

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
